{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:32 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:32 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:32 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80a95e31b86b470c308d49a07ab7f898/2026-11/012.png\"/><p>​香港海關今日（4日）在香港國際機場偵破一宗旅客販運毒品的案件。一名36歲的本地男旅客今日從馬來西亞吉隆坡飛抵本港，海關人員清關時，在他所穿着的鞋內發現約1公斤懷疑可卡因，估計市值約60萬元，遂把該名男子拘捕。</p><img alt=\"案件中檢獲的收藏於鞋內的懷疑可卡因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6103d7a30a9ff16ab20c9638a435407/2026-11/5358C719DFCB4DF8837196B852E8E2FF_O.jpeg\" title=\"案件中檢獲的收藏於鞋內的懷疑可卡因。\"/><p>案件中檢獲的收藏於鞋內的懷疑可卡因。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:45:40.415933+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:32:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:41.201402+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:41.201402+00:00","content_hash":"5df6ba9a95001da6c3308f8251942005bd3731b073641805b3a78282da69f743","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}